<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO APRIL NET UP TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO APRIL NET UP TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.12 vs   1.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.22 vs   1.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.27 vs   2.08</p>
<p> Sales		   19.19 vs  14.68</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.97 vs   6.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.17 vs   9.16</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.47 vs   9.96</p>
<p> Sales		   70.48 vs  60.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
